OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic opportunity' to have
OL,4,Apenguin colony as neighbours
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorking beside a colony of penguins is
OL,7,Fnot often in any job description but a
OL,8,Fteam of dedicated volunteers are making
OL,9,Fthe 9,000-mile journey to Antarctica to
OL,10,Fprotect a British science base.
OL,12,FThe team will be based on Goudier
OL,13,FIsland, which is about the size of a
OL,14,Ffootball pitch, for five months to
OL,15,Fcarry out significant repairs on Port
OL,16,FLockroy - home of the world's most
OL,17,Fremote Post Office.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
