OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic opportunity' to have
OL,4,Apenguin colony as neighbours
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Air Force veteran Carole
OL,7,FMcCullough, who is leading the group,
OL,8,Fsaid while she will miss her daily
OL,9,Fruns, it was an opportunity she
OL,10,Fcouldn't pass up.
OL,12,F"I will just open the door and look at
OL,13,Fthe beautiful surroundings and our
OL,14,Flocal neighbours are a massive penguin
OL,15,Fcolony, so that will be fantastic," she
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
